{"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"15.0"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"13.0"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"16.0"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"1.0"},{"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSLinearProgressIndicatorV","roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"}],"title":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A linear indicator shows the progress of a task using a horizontal line."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It can show a specific value (determinate) or just that something is in progress (indeterminate)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best used inside layouts to show progress."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslinearprogressindicator"]}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/init(status:track:helperText:helperTextAlignment:gapSize:accessibility:)"]},{"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/body"]},{"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextAlignment","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType"]},{"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/View-Implementations"]}],"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSLinearProgressIndicator"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Indicators"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Variants","type":"heading","text":"Variants"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two variants are provided:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the caller provides a "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" value in "},{"code":"[0, 1]","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Values outside this range are coerced."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows the exact progress of a task, usually as a percentage from 0% to 100%."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Provides clear and measurable feedback, helping users understand how long the task will take and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reducing uncertainty."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Use determinate indicators whenever possible. Avoid indeterminate when progress can be measured, e.g."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"when the progress value is known (file upload, installation, data sync) or when the system can estimate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completion time or percentage."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": no "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided and the indicator loops continuously."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Shows that a process is active without indicating exact progress."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Used when the system cannot determine how long the task will take."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Communicates that the system is working, even without precise data, and prevents users from thinking"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the interface is frozen."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For long loading times (over 5 seconds), additional context must be provided."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Statuses","type":"heading","text":"Statuses"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Neutral","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": default status used when progress has no specific semantic meaning. Suitable for generic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"loading, processing, synchronization or background tasks."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Accent","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used to highlight primary or brand-related actions (uploads, downloads, installations,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"onboarding)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Positive","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates successful progress or a process leading to a successful outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Info","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates informational or system-related processes (background synchronization, data"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"retrieval)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Warning","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an operation that requires user attention or should be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"monitored."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Negative","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": indicates progress related to an error, recovery, cancellation or failure."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Gap-size","type":"heading","text":"Gap size"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"default","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": standard gap between the bar and the track (base Android Material 3 specification)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": reduced gap for a more compact appearance."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Track","type":"heading","text":"Track"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): the track is displayed. Recommended when the indicator is shown on its own and needs"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a clear structure. The track helps define the full range of progress and makes the value easier to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"read."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": the track is hidden. Recommended when the indicator is embedded inside another component"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(button, tag, toast) or when a more minimal appearance is needed."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Stop-indicator-determinate-only","type":"heading","text":"Stop indicator (determinate only)"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default): no stop indicator is drawn."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": a small square (or dot if the theme uses rounded caps) is drawn at the end of the track to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"identify the end of the range easily. Required by accessibility criteria when the track has a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"contrast below 3:1 with its container or the surface behind the container."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The stop indicator is only available on the determinate variant, matching the Android Material 3","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"specification: the indeterminate variant has no meaningful end position for it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Helper-text","type":"heading","text":"Helper text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional text displayed below the progress bar to provide context or additional information.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/HelperTextType","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" which offers two variants:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".description(_:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays a simple description text without the progress percentage."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"alignment","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter controls horizontal alignment ("},{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".percent(description:alignment:)","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Displays the progress percentage with an optional description."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The percentage value and its "},{"code":"%","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" symbol are assembled through the localized wording key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"core_progressIndicator_percent_value","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", so the symbol, its spacing and its position follow the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"typographic rules of the current language (e.g. "},{"code":"\"75%\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in English, "},{"code":"\"75 %\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in French, "},{"code":"\"٪75\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" in Arabic)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".center"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), only the percentage is shown, centered."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".start"},{"type":"text","text":", the percentage is at the leading edge and the description (if provided) at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"alignment"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".end"},{"type":"text","text":", the description (if provided) is at the leading edge and the percentage at the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"In ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" mode, the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperText"},{"text":" parameter is a simple ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String?"},{"text":" with a separate ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"helperTextAlignment"},{"text":" parameter:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".center","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (default): The text is centered under the progress bar."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".start","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the leading edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".end","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The text is aligned to the trailing edge."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Animation","type":"heading","text":"Animation"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": when "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" (default), the indicator progressively fills from "},{"code":"0","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the target "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on first display and animates any subsequent change of "},{"code":"progress","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(based on Android Material 3 specifications). When "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"false","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", the indicator is displayed instantly at its target value with no animation."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": the Android Material 3 two-line animation is intrinsic to the mode and cannot be disabled from the call site; there is no "},{"code":"animated","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"parameter on the indeterminate initializer."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Animations are always disabled and a static bar filled at 70% is displayed when either","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibilityReduceMotion"},{"text":" is ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":" or Low Power Mode is enabled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Determinate-Basic-usage","type":"heading","text":"Determinate — Basic usage"},{"code":["    \/\/ Determinate — default (neutral, with track, default gap, reveal animation)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75)","","    \/\/ Determinate with an accent status, no track and a helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                status: .accent,","                                track: false,","                                helperText: .description(\"Uploading…\"))","","    \/\/ Description aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5, helperText: .description(\"Uploading...\", alignment: .end))","","    \/\/ Percentage centered (default)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75, helperText: .percent())","","    \/\/ Percentage with description at start (percentage leading, description trailing)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                helperText: .percent(description: \"of 100 MB\", alignment: .start))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info)","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .accent, helperText: \"Processing…\")","","    \/\/ Helper text aligned to the end","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                helperText: \"Loading data…\",","                                helperTextAlignment: .end)","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility name and state for VoiceOver","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.75,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"download bar\", state: \"downloading\"))","","    \/\/ Determinate with accessibility and helper text","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(progress: 0.5,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"progress bar\", state: \"step 1 of 4\"),","                                helperText: .description(\"Loading...\"))","","    \/\/ Indeterminate with accessibility","    OUDSLinearProgressIndicator(status: .info,","                                accessibility: .init(name: \"loading\", state: \"processing\"))"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter to provide a custom name and state for VoiceOver:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.name"},{"type":"text","text":": The name of the component (e.g., “progress bar”, “download bar”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"accessibility.state"},{"type":"text","text":": The state of the component (e.g., “downloading”, “step 1 of 4”)"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"VoiceOver reads: "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"[name]. [state]. [helperText] [value]","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". Example: "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“download bar. downloading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If "},{"code":"accessibility","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not provided, the behavior is unchanged: only the helper text (if provided) is used as label."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode, the view exposes the current progress as an accessibility value (percentage)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so that Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", and is marked with the "},{"code":".updatesFrequently","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" trait so that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"assistive technologies know the value is changing. If a "},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, it is exposed as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"accessibility label (Voice Over reads e.g. "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"“Uploading. 75 percent”","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The indicator never captures "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Full Keyboard Access","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" focus, as no interaction is possible on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"progress indicator. On iOS 17+ \/ macOS 14+ \/ visionOS 1+ \/ watchOS 10+ \/ tvOS 17+, this is enforced"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"via "},{"code":"accessibilityRespondsToUserInteraction(false)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"; on earlier OS versions, the semantic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":".isStaticText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" trait is used."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" mode without helper text, the view is hidden from Voice Over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"code":".accessibilityHidden(true)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":") — and therefore also excluded from Full Keyboard Access navigation:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"there is no readable value to expose. When a "},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is provided, the helper text is exposed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"as accessibility label so the user still understands the context."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Animations are disabled when "},{"code":"accessibilityReduceMotion","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or when Low Power Mode is enabled."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Colored-surfaces","type":"heading","text":"Colored surfaces"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When placed on an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSColoredSurface","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":", the indicator switches to a ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"monochrome","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" rendering, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"status"},{"text":" is ignored.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading","text":"Design documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-linear-progress-indicator","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading","text":"Themes rendering"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange","type":"heading","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Orange-Compact","type":"heading","text":"Orange Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Sosh","type":"heading","text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Wireframe","type":"heading","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_Wireframe","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"style":"note","name":"Version","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.2.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"style":"note","name":"Since","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"3.0.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"sections":[],"references":{"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact":{"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSComponents\/component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"identifier":"component_progress_indicator_linear_OrangeCompact","type":"image","alt":"A linear progress indicator component in light and dark modes with Orange Compact theme"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslinearprogressindicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopindicator:helpertext:gapsize:animated:accessibility:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"determinate","type":"text"}]},{"text":" linear progress indicator.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSLinearProgressIndicator\/init(progress:status:track:stopIndicator:helperText:gapSize:animated:accessibility:)","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"progress"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"status"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14OUDSComponents27OUDSProgressIndicatorStatusO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OUDSProgressIndicatorStatus"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"track"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier",